    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consciousness...  Where? Unknown. Who are all these dudes in robes? Only one way forward: through the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about finding your path, surviving the mysterious afterlife, and solving the riddle of your purpose in this curious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will continue to grow with more features and content. Keep an eye out for updates on the official website!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated roguelike runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support (or mouse and keyboard) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metagame unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming creatures, and one total asshole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obnoxiously colorful levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable encounters and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese-friendly combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AAA bs</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consciousness...  Where? Unknown. Who are all these dudes in robes? Only one way forward: through the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about finding your path, surviving the mysterious afterlife, and solving the riddle of your purpose in this curious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will continue to grow with more features and content. Keep an eye out for updates on the official website!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated roguelike runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support (or mouse and keyboard) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metagame unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming creatures, and one total asshole</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire powerful weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obnoxiously colorful levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memorable encounters and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese-friendly combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AAA bs</p></li></ul>",
